# Supply-chain hardening (handover #6).
#
# pnpm 10+ already blocks dependency install/build (lifecycle) scripts unless
# the package is allow-listed in pnpm-workspace.yaml > onlyBuiltDependencies.
# We additionally disable implicit pre/post script wrappers so a contributor
# cannot smuggle a pretest/postinstall-style wrapper that auto-runs around our
# own scripts on `pnpm install` / `pnpm run`.
#
# NOTE: do NOT set `ignore-scripts=true` here as a blanket rule — it silences
# every dependency build script, including ones we may later need to approve
# explicitly in pnpm-workspace.yaml (onlyBuiltDependencies). better-sqlite3
# itself no longer needs a build script since 13.x (prebuilds are bundled in
# the tarball); see the comment in pnpm-workspace.yaml.
enable-pre-post-scripts=false
